WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:07.073
&gt;&gt;&gt; IT HAPPENED AGAIN.
I THOUGHT IT WAS BEHIND ME, BUT

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:12.812 size:78% position:39%
THE DREAMS CAME BACK.
I WAS UP ALL NIGHT.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:16.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
I CAN'T EAT.
I CAN'T SLEEP.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:25.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S WRONG?
&gt;&gt; IT HAUNTS ME.

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:28.728
&gt;&gt; OH, STEVEN NOT THIS AGAIN.
&gt;&gt; I FORGOT ABOUT IT FOR YEARS,

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:33.199
BUT THEN I REMEMBERED THAT
AVATAR, THE GIANT INTERNATIONAL

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:38.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
BLOCKBUSTER, USED THE PAPYRUS
FONT AS IT'S LOGO.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:43.276
&gt;&gt; AVATAR, LIKE, THAT MOVIE FROM
NINE YEARS AGO?

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:48.381
&gt;&gt; YEAH, HE JUST HIGHLIGHTED
AVATAR, HE CLICKED THE DROP DOWN

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:52.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
MENU, AND THEN HE RANDOMLY
SELECTED PAPYRUS.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:57.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
LIKE A THOUGHTLESS CHILD
WANDERING BY A GARDEN YANKING

00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:00.427 align:start size:94% position:6%
LEAVES ALONG THE WAY.
&gt;&gt; AND SO NOW YOU ARE WORRIED

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:03.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
ABOUT THE SEQUELS THAT ARE
COMING OUT?

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:07.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE MAKING MORE?
&gt;&gt; YEAH, WELL, I THINK I HEARD

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:10.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
THAT.
&gt;&gt; THEY CHANGED THE ARTWORK.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:19.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
THEY FIXED IT.
&gt;&gt; IT LOOKS SIMILAR.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:27.420
&gt;&gt; HE JUST GOT AWAY WITH IT.
THIS MAN, THIS PROFESSIONAL

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
GRAPHIC DESIGNER.
WAS IT LAZINESS?

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:34.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
WAS IT CRUELTY?
&gt;&gt; YOU SHOWED ME THIS BEFORE.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.563
I DON'T THINK THIS IS LITERALLY
PAPYRUS.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.231
MAYBE THAT WAS THE STARTING
POINT BUT THEY CLEARLY MODIFIED

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:40.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
THIS.
&gt;&gt; BUT WHATEVER THEY DID, IT

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:49.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
WASN'T ENOUGH!
AND NOW HERE I AM DOING WHAT I

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:52.679
VOWED TO NEVER DO AGAIN, SITTING
OUTSIDE HIS HOUSE, HOPING TO

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:56.182
CATCH A GLIMPSE OF HIM TO SEE
HIM DOING HIS LITTLE THINGS,

00:01:56.182 --> 00:02:02.755
LIVE HIS INSANE LITTLE LIFE.
I THINK ABOUT IT EVERY TIME I

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
SEE PAPYRUS.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:06.860
WHERE ELSE DO YOU EVEN SEE THIS
FONT?

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:22.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HOOKAH BARS.
TEQUILA MERCH OFF BRAND TEES.

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:26.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
SHAKIRAM MERCH.
&gt;&gt; MY GOD.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
ARE YOU OKAY?
WHAT HAPPENED?

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:30.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DO YOU REMEMBER THE AVATAR
LOGO.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YEAH.
IT WAS TRIBAL YET FUTURISTIC.

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:46.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; PAPYRUS.
&gt;&gt; SURE.

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:49.035 size:84% position:42%
&gt;&gt; I KNOW WHAT YOU DID.
I KNOW WHAT YOU DID!

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:54.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:55.108 size:84% position:42%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

